    "crc_polynomials": "Classical CAN: X^15 + X^14 + X^10 + X^8 + X^7 + X^4 + X^3 + 1 (hex 0x4599 in 15-bit form). CAN FD ISO mode: CRC-17 (≤16 B payload) + CRC-21 (>16 B payload), each prefixed with 3-bit stuff-bit-count + 1-bit parity per ISO 11898-1:2015. CAN FD non-ISO mode: same CRC-17 / CRC-21 polynomials without stuff-count protection.",
